# NOTE: backend/migrations/*.sql is intentionally NOT ignored — those are the
# real, version-controlled schema history for this project (matches the "no
# ORM, migrations checked into git" convention used throughout this repo).
# The old blanket `migrations/` rule here was silently excluding all of them
# from git entirely; removed.